Open browser:
http://localhost/phpmyadmin




How to remove warning in php
vim /usr/share/nginx/html/phpmyadmin/libraries/config.default.php
And change $cfg['SendErrorReports'] = 'ask'; to
$cfg['SendErrorReports'] = 'never';


How to remove 413 file too large

vi /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
add 1 line 
client_max_body_size 200M; in http
and in /etc/php/8.1/fpm/php.ini
Post_max_size = 200M
upload_max_file_size = 200M


